# The v2 intermediate for the deep field. Only galaxies_sdss_o.bin (the octree) is
# read by the viewer; this 51MB file is regenerable with to_bin.py from the CSV,
# which fetch_sdss_galaxies.py regenerates in turn. The older layers keep their
# intermediates tracked for historical reasons — no need to add 51MB more.
galaxies_sdss.bin

